":"paragraph","text":"やっぱとりあえず、くまのぬいぐるみ！\n実家帰るとたくさんあるよ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キャラクターなら前書いた他にチップとデールのチップとか、プーさんとか、ディズニーだったら何でも好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▽結構食べる方？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ食べます（笑）\n手羽先20？30？食べたけど、まだまだ全然食べれました！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの時は手羽先に味噌カツにひつまぶしに唐揚げ、サラダ×3、デザート…いっぱい食べたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▽女の子のファンってどう思いますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えっ(；；)すーっごく嬉しいです(；；)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファッションとか美容のこととか色々話せるし…うん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっと色んな方から愛される人になれるよう頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば、昨日たくさんのファンレターやプレゼントを頂きました！\n本当にありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/weep.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何回も言ってますが、皆さんの暖かい言葉が私を成長させる鍵です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日もファンレター一つ一つ読んでて胸が熱くなりまし